    "- **Metric mismatch:** visualization may use Euclidean distance while retrieval uses cosine similarity.\n",
    "- **Crowding:** many points in high dimension must be packed into a small two-dimensional region.\n",
    "- **Overinterpretation:** visible clusters may be artifacts of projection, preprocessing, or selected examples.\n",
    "\n",
